== ask
docker compose publish r/app:1
== allow
docker-compose exec app git status
== ask a forced push with push options still reads as forced (its reason is checked in test-hooks.sh)
git push -fo ci.skip origin main
== ask docker image build is buildx build
docker image build --push -t app .
== ask compose option values that look like subcommands
docker compose --profile build push
== ask
docker compose -p up push
== ask a push option named tag asks about the option, not a tag push
git push -o tag origin main
== ask docker-compose global options with values
docker-compose --log-level DEBUG push
== ask docker compose alpha publish
docker compose -f a.yml alpha publish r/app
